BSIM1 common-source AC (spice-ts #657)
* Project-authored deck. The .MODEL card is the unchanged BSIM1 card of the
* SPICE3F5 bsim1tst.cir test deck (corpus classic/bsim1-device-sweep).
MN1 out in 0 sub nmos L=10U W=50.0U AD=100P AS=100P PD=40U PS=40U
RL vdd out 10K
CL out 0 0.2P
VDD vdd 0 5
VSUB sub 0 -1
VIN in 0 DC 1.5 AC 1
.AC DEC 10 1K 10G
